<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
This class inherits from :cpp:class:`IniResource`

Base class for a resource to be fixed in the .ini file -- mirrors the pure-Python
``IniFixResource`` class (``model/iniresources/IniResource.py``); see :cpp:class:`IniResource`&apos;s
own doc comment for why the generic ``fixFunc`` mechanism isn&apos;t carried over to this level
</verbatim> </para>
